      <memberdef kind="function" id="main_8cpp_1ae66f6b31b5ad750f1fe042a706a4e3d4" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>int</type>
        <definition>int main</definition>
        <argsstring>()</argsstring>
        <name>main</name>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Entry point for the EngineProject application. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Creates the main <ref refid="classApplication" kindref="compound">Application</ref> instance, initializes all engine subsystems, and selects the initial scene based on the DEMO_2D_FIXED preprocessor macro.</para>
<para>If DEMO_2D_FIXED is defined, the application starts directly in the <ref refid="classDemo2DFixedScene" kindref="compound">Demo2DFixedScene</ref> (a 2D platformer demo with a fixed camera). Otherwise, it starts in the <ref refid="classMenuScene" kindref="compound">MenuScene</ref>, allowing the user to navigate to different game modes.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>int Returns 0 on successful execution, 1 if initialization fails.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classApplication" kindref="compound">Application</ref>, <ref refid="classDemo2DFixedScene" kindref="compound">Demo2DFixedScene</ref>, <ref refid="classMenuScene" kindref="compound">MenuScene</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
